<rtept lat="51.8147360000" lon="-1.3781400000">
<time>2025-08-12T08:12:38Z</time>
<name>Entry to Wood to End</name>
<desc>At the two posts marking the entry to Pinsley Wood, turn right. From here, follow the broad path as it winds its way along the edge of the wood, performing a complete loop. If in season, you'll see the marvellous display of bluebells. On returning to the point of entry, turn right and follow the path back to the car park.</desc>
<sym>Flag</sym>
<type>Marks</type>
<extensions>
<xstyle:fill>
<xstyle:color>ff0000</xstyle:color>
</xstyle:fill>
</extensions>
